# Copy this file to google_api_key.location or openrouter_api_key.location.
# Comfy Cloud has NO key file: sign into the app. A headless box puts the
# key in OTR_COMFY_API_KEY on the SUBMITTING machine (scripts/otr_api.py
# sends it as extra_data.api_key_comfy_org); the server never reads it.
#
# First real line is the full path to YOUR key file. The key itself
# stays in that other file. This file is gitignored once renamed.
#
# C:\Users\you\keys\google.txt
